      "message": "\"The export of a library with only `syntax-rules` macros and no compiled syntax, which no code at expansion time looks up, is remapped when one of its macros is first used, not with its importer\" overstates it.\n\n- A library imported directly is still remapped as it is imported. Only the dependencies of an imported library (and the seed\u0027s) wait.\n- \"Which no code at expansion time looks up\" isn\u0027t true of what that library itself imports (see context.rs:333).\n\nPlease reword once the walk is fixed.",
